  "content": "<h5><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jm3PCWv.png\" alt=\"\"></h5><h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 完全重制世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 全面优化，支持光影</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 自定义<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.horizon.pics%252f39d7ccdc-f694-466a-832b-027a84051a8f%253fa%253d580%2526mime1%253dimage%2526mime2%253dpng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">光影预设</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 重制要塞与堡垒</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 数百个全新地牢与结构（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moog's Voyager Structures</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adorabuild-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdoraBuild: Structures</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/formations-overworld\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Formations</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 新Boss与生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs-1-21-1-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends &amp; Foes</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 生活质量功能：如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">传送石碑</a>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-tome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">经验书</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 包含1.21.2+内容（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/vanillabackport\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Backport</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的小地图</a>，附带<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeroplus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">额外功能</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-mounts-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可骑乘的龙</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 多项自定义功能，提升游戏体验</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 内置<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免费世界共享</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f29331%252fbetter-mc-neoforge-bmc5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">320+模组</a></strong></h5><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LfhUwM-LkZ8\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a9SYvVghFlA\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>非官方 Minecraft 产品。未经 Mojang 或 Microsoft 批准，亦与其无关联。</strong></span></p>",
